{"name":"Meetinghouse Blue","hex":"#739dad","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"meetinghouse","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A building where people meet for a purpose.","A building where a Quaker congregation assembles for worship."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/meetinghouse"},{"term":"blue","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a blue hue.","Depressed, melancholic, sad."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The colour of the clear sky or the deep sea; the colour midway between green and violet in the visible spectrum and one of the primary additive colours.","Anything coloured blue, especially to distinguish it from similar objects differing only in colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/blue"}],"entries":[{"title":"Meeting house","blocks":[{"text":"A meeting house is a building for religious, public, or private meetings. It is primarily associated with Christian worship of certain movements after the Protestant Reformation of the 16th century, or later movements that developed on a Christian basis."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Meeting_house_marlboro_vermont_20040911.jpg/330px-Meeting_house_marlboro_vermont_20040911.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meeting_house","wikidata":"Q6807904"},{"title":"Blue","blocks":[{"text":"Blue is one of the three primary colours in the RGB (additive) colour model, as well as in the RYB colour model. It lies between violet and cyan on the spectrum of visible light. The term blue generally describes colours perceived by humans observing light with a dominant wavelength between approximately 450 and 495 nanometres. The clear daytime sky and the deep sea appear blue because of an optical effect known as Rayleigh scattering. An optical effect called the Tyndall effect explains blue eyes. Distant objects appear more blue because of another optical effect called aerial perspective."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Earth-in-true-color-himawari-09.jpg/330px-Earth-in-true-color-himawari-09.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue","wikidata":"Q1088"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/Old_German_Baptist_Brethren_Church%2C_New_Conference_church_house_in_Modesto_district_%28Modesto%2C_CA%29.jpg/500px-Old_German_Baptist_Brethren_Church%2C_New_Conference_church_house_in_Modesto_district_%28Modesto%2C_CA%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/Old_German_Baptist_Brethren_Church%2C_New_Conference_church_house_in_Modesto_district_%28Modesto%2C_CA%29.jpg/1280px-Old_German_Baptist_Brethren_Church%2C_New_Conference_church_house_in_Modesto_district_%28Modesto%2C_CA%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/Old_German_Baptist_Brethren_Church%2C_New_Conference_church_house_in_Modesto_district_%28Modesto%2C_CA%29.jpg/500px-Old_German_Baptist_Brethren_Church%2C_New_Conference_church_house_in_Modesto_district_%28Modesto%2C_CA%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The interior of the meetinghouse of the Modesto Congeragation of the Old German Baptist Brethren Church, New Conference, a Schwarzenau Brethren Anabaptist denomination (Modesto, California)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AOld_German_Baptist_Brethren_Church%2C_New_Conference_church_house_in_Modesto_district_(Modesto%2C_CA).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/Baltimore_Friends_Meeting.JPG/500px-Baltimore_Friends_Meeting.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikim